{"id": "bac8a8de-9480-4b32-a108-a22240758ae9", "slug": "vertex-platform-2", "title": "Vertex Platform", "description": "Vertex Platform Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Vertex Platform\"\ndescription: \"Vertex Platform Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#4D7C0F\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#A3E635\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#2A2D35\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#2A2D35\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Vertex Platform\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 52; favorites: 20; remixes: 3.\nTags: hero, section, animated, webgl, threejs, cta, effect.\n## Overview\nVertex Platform Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\n\nVertex Log In Docs Rates Start Now Deploy Scalable AI Architectures Accelerate computational workflows. Empower engineering teams with an integrated ecosystem that operates with unprecedented precision. Virtually fricti…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Deploy Scalable AI Architectures.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #4D7C0F, secondary #000000, accent #A3E635, background #000000, surface #2A2D35, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Vertex Platform</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&amp;family=Playfair+Display:wght@500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-geist\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\">\n    <style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-geist\">.font-geist { font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif !important; }</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"text-gray-100 font-['Inter',sans-serif] min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#a3e635] selection:text-black\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #181a1f 0%, #090a0c 100%);\">\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"relative z-20 w-full max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-8 h-[88px] flex items-center justify-between\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 drop-shadow-md\">\n            <span class=\"font-medium text-xl tracking-tight text-white font-geist\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">Vertex</span>\n        </div>\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm text-gray-400 font-medium\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">Log In</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">Docs</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">Rates</a>\n\n            <!-- Border Gradient Nav Button -->\n            <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-full overflow-hidden inline-flex shadow-[0_4px_10px_rgba(163,230,53,0.3)]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #d9f99d 0%, #4d7c0f 100%);\">\n                <button class=\"text-gray-900 px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold transition-all hover:brightness-110 active:brightness-95 font-geist w-full h-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #bef264 0%, #84cc16 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.6), inset 0 -2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); text-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\">\n                    Start Now\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Stage -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[1400px] mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center min-h-[calc(100vh-88px)] px-8 py-12 lg:py-0\">\n\n        <!-- Left Column (Content) -->\n        <div class=\"w-full lg:w-[45%] flex flex-col items-start pt-12 lg:pt-0 z-20\">\n\n            <h1 id=\"reveal-title\" class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl leading-[1.1] text-left text-white max-w-2xl mb-8 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-bottom pb-2 -mb-2\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(120%);\">Deploy</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-bottom pb-2 -mb-2\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(120%);\">Scalable</span></span><br>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-bottom pb-2 -mb-2\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(120%);\">AI</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-bottom pb-2 -mb-2\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(120%);\">Architectures</span></span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"text-base text-gray-400 leading-relaxed max-w-md font-geist mb-10\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">\n                Accelerate computational workflows. Empower engineering teams with an integrated ecosystem that operates with unprecedented precision. Virtually frictionless.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-start gap-4 relative z-30\">\n                <!-- Border Gradient Primary CTA -->\n                <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-full overflow-hidden inline-flex shadow-[0_6px_16px_rgba(163,230,53,0.3)]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #d9f99d 0%, #4d7c0f 100%);\">\n                    <button class=\"text-gray-900 px-7 py-3 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold transition-all flex items-center gap-2 hover:brightness-110 active:brightness-95 font-geist w-full h-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #bef264 0%, #84cc16 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.6), inset 0 -2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); text-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\">\n                        Explore Platform\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.4));\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Border Gradient Secondary CTA -->\n                <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-full overflow-hidden inline-flex shadow-[0_6px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #4b505c 0%, #111318 100%);\">\n                    <button class=\"text-gray-200 px-7 py-3 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-all hover:text-white hover:brightness-110 active:brightness-95 font-geist w-full h-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2d35 0%, #1a1c23 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), inset 0 -2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">\n                        View Pricing\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"mt-20 text-xs text-gray-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-medium font-geist\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n                /DATASETS\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Column (3D Visual) -->\n        <div class=\"w-full lg:w-[55%] mt-16 lg:mt-0 flex justify-center lg:justify-end relative pointer-events-none\">\n            <!-- Pseudo-WebGL 3D Scene Container -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[800px] aspect-square\" style=\"perspective: 1200px;\">\n                <div id=\"scene-root\" class=\"w-full h-full absolute inset-0\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d; transform: rotateX(55deg) rotateZ(-40deg);\">\n                    <!-- JavaScript will inject the layered 3D blocks here -->\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- JS Engine for 3D/WebGL simulation & Animations -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            // GSAP Masked Reveal\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n            gsap.to(\".reveal-word\", {\n                y: 0,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \"#reveal-title\",\n                    start: \"top 85%\",\n                }\n            });\n\n            // 3D Scene Logic\n            const sceneRoot = document.getElementById('scene-root');\n            const blocks = [];\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            let time = 0;\n\n            const sceneConfig = [\n                // Base Dark Block (02 DATA)\n                {\n                    id: 'block-data',\n                    width: 320, height: 320, depth: 30,\n                    x: -80, y: 80, z: -50,\n                    topGradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #1f2229 0%, #15171c 100%)',\n                    sideColor: 'bg-[#0a0b0e]',\n                    content: `<div class=\"text-gray-500 font-['Inter'] text-xs font-medium tracking-widest p-6 uppercase\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">/02<br>INFO<br><br><div class=\"flex gap-2 mt-2 opacity-60\"><div class=\"w-2 h-6 rounded-sm border border-black\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #111 0%, #222 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\"></div><div class=\"w-2 h-6 rounded-sm border border-black\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #111 0%, #222 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\"></div><div class=\"w-2 h-6 rounded-sm border border-black\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #111 0%, #222 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\"></div><div class=\"w-2 h-6 rounded-sm border border-black\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #111 0%, #222 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\"></div></div></div>`,\n                    floatingOffset: 0, floatingSpeed: 0.02\n                },\n                // Middle Skeuomorphic Blocks\n                {\n                    id: 'block-mid-1',\n                    width: 160, height: 160, depth: 25,\n                    x: -20, y: -20, z: 40,\n                    topGradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #2a2d35 0%, #1a1c23 100%)',\n                    sideColor: 'bg-[#4d7c0f]',\n                    content: `<div class=\"text-gray-400 font-['Inter'] text-xs font-medium tracking-widest p-4 uppercase\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">/01 BASE</div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full border border-black/80\" style=\"background: rgba(20,22,28,0.3); box-shadow: inset 0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\"></div></div>`,\n                    floatingOffset: Math.PI / 4, floatingSpeed: 0.025\n                },\n                {\n                    id: 'block-mid-2',\n                    width: 160, height: 160, depth: 25,\n                    x: -20, y: 160, z: 40,\n                    topGradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #2a2d35 0%, #1a1c23 100%)',\n                    sideColor: 'bg-[#4d7c0f]',\n                    content: `<div class=\"text-gray-400 font-['Inter'] text-xs font-medium tracking-widest p-4 uppercase\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">/01 BASE</div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full border border-black/80\" style=\"background: rgba(20,22,28,0.3); box-shadow: inset 0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\"></div></div>`,\n                    floatingOffset: Math.PI / 2, floatingSpeed: 0.025\n                },\n                {\n                    id: 'block-mid-3',\n                    width: 160, height: 160, depth: 25,\n                    x: 160, y: 160, z: 40,\n                    topGradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #2a2d35 0%, #1a1c23 100%)',\n                    sideColor: 'bg-[#4d7c0f]',\n                    content: `<div class=\"text-gray-400 font-['Inter'] text-xs font-medium tracking-widest p-4 uppercase\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">/01 BASE</div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full border border-black/80\" style=\"background: rgba(20,22,28,0.3); box-shadow: inset 0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\"></div></div>`,\n                    floatingOffset: Math.PI * 0.75, floatingSpeed: 0.025\n                },\n                // Top Main Block\n                {\n                    id: 'block-core-main',\n                    width: 320, height: 320, depth: 35,\n                    x: 100, y: -100, z: 120,\n                    topGradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #2c3038 0%, #1e2028 100%)',\n                    sideColor: 'bg-[#4d7c0f]',\n                    content: `<div class=\"w-full h-full relative p-8\">\n                        <div class=\"text-gray-400 font-['Inter'] text-xs font-medium tracking-widest uppercase\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">/01<br>BASE</div>\n\n                        <!-- Skeuomorphic decorative geometric indent -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-32 h-32 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                           <div class=\"w-full h-8 rounded-full border border-black absolute transform rotate-45\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #15171c 0%, #1e2028 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\"></div>\n                           <div class=\"w-full h-8 rounded-full border border-black absolute transform -rotate-45\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #15171c 0%, #1e2028 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Screws/Dots -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 w-2 h-2 rounded-full border border-black\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2d35 0%, #15171c 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 w-2 h-2 rounded-full border border-black\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2d35 0%, #15171c 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 w-2 h-2 rounded-full border border-black\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2d35 0%, #15171c 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\"></div>\n                    </div>`,\n                    floatingOffset: Math.PI, floatingSpeed: 0.015\n                }\n            ];\n\n            function createLayeredBlock(config) {\n                const wrapper = document.createElement('div');\n                wrapper.className = 'absolute';\n                wrapper.style.left = '50%';\n                wrapper.style.top = '50%';\n                wrapper.style.width = config.width + 'px';\n                wrapper.style.height = config.height + 'px';\n                wrapper.style.marginLeft = -(config.width / 2) + config.x + 'px';\n                wrapper.style.marginTop = -(config.height / 2) + config.y + 'px';\n                wrapper.style.transformStyle = 'preserve-3d';\n\n                // Base shadow\n                const shadowBase = document.createElement('div');\n                shadowBase.className = `absolute inset-0 rounded-[2rem]`;\n                shadowBase.style.transform = `translateZ(-${config.depth}px)`;\n                shadowBase.style.boxShadow = '0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)';\n                wrapper.appendChild(shadowBase);\n\n                // Extruded layers\n                for (let i = 0; i <= config.depth; i++) {\n                    const layer = document.createElement('div');\n                    layer.className = `absolute inset-0 rounded-[2rem] ${config.sideColor}`;\n                    layer.style.transform = `translateZ(-${i}px)`;\n                    layer.style.boxShadow = 'inset 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.9)';\n                    wrapper.appendChild(layer);\n                }\n\n                // Top Surface\n                const topFace = document.createElement('div');\n                topFace.className = `absolute inset-0 rounded-[2rem] border overflow-hidden`;\n                topFace.style.background = config.topGradient;\n                topFace.style.borderColor = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)';\n                topFace.style.boxShadow = 'inset 0 2px 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.05), inset 0 -3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.8)';\n                topFace.style.transform = 'translateZ(1px)';\n                topFace.innerHTML = config.content;\n                wrapper.appendChild(topFace);\n\n                sceneRoot.appendChild(wrapper);\n\n                return {\n                    element: wrapper,\n                    baseZ: config.z,\n                    offset: config.floatingOffset,\n                    speed: config.floatingSpeed\n                };\n            }\n\n            // Initialize scene\n            sceneConfig.forEach(config => {\n                blocks.push(createLayeredBlock(config));\n            });\n\n            // Track mouse for subtle parallax\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                mouseX = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth) - 0.5;\n                mouseY = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight) - 0.5;\n            });\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            function animate() {\n                time += 1;\n\n                // Subtle scene rotation based on mouse\n                const targetRotateX = 55 - (mouseY * 12);\n                const targetRotateZ = -40 + (mouseX * 12);\n\n                sceneRoot.style.transform = `rotateX(${targetRotateX}deg) rotateZ(${targetRotateZ}deg)`;\n\n                // Animate individual blocks floating\n                blocks.forEach(block => {\n                    const floatZ = Math.sin((time * block.speed) + block.offset) * 15;\n                    block.element.style.transform = `translateZ(${block.baseZ + floatZ}px)`;\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            }\n\n            animate();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "vertex-platform-2.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/vertex-platform-2.jpg", "source_name": "vertex-platform-2-DESIGN.md", "views": 273, "forks": 17, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T14:00:59.608167+00:00"}